<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Pharmacy Management & Dispensing</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A high-integrity pharmaceutical ecosystem that combines secure medication fulfillment 
            with precision inventory management and real-time clinical safety checks.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Seamless Prescription Fulfillment</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate errors from illegible handwriting with integrated E-Prescribing. Digital 
            prescriptions authorized by clinicians are transmitted instantly to the 
            Pharmacy worklist. Pharmacists and technicians manage the fulfillment process 
            through a structured workflow—Reviewing, Picking, Labeling, and Dispensing—ensuring 
            that every step is documented. The system provides automated cross-checks 
            against the patient's allergy profile, providing an additional layer of 
            medication safety.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated generation of standardized medication labels—including dosage 
            instructions and patient-specific warnings—ensures clarity for the 
            end-user and compliance with pharmaceutical standards.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Precision Inventory & Expiry Control</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain the continuity of care through sophisticated stock oversight. The Pharmacy 
            module tracks every tablet and vial through 'Batch' and 'Expiry' management. 
            Real-time stock levels are maintained across the main pharmacy and ward-based 
            medicine cabinets, with automated alerts for low stock thresholds and 
            upcoming item expirations. This proactive management minimizes wastage 
            from expired inventory while ensuring that life-saving medications are 
            always available.
        </p>
        <p>
            Integrated procurement workflows facilitate rapid re-ordering from approved 
            wholesalers, with full historical price tracking to ensure cost-efficient 
            pharmaceutical management.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Revenue Capture & Accountability</h2>
        <p>
            Ensure every medication dispensed is accurately billed. The system automatically 
            captures charges for all fulfilled prescriptions, creating immediate 
            multi-currency invoices or medical aid claims as part of the unified 
            billing cycle. Granular audit trails log every movement of scheduled 
            drugs (Dangerous Drugs), providing the forensic accountability required 
            for regulatory inspections and internal governance audits.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

